WEBVTT

00:00:00.557 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.172 --> 00:00:04.014
Would you like to get your nails, lashes or hair done,

00:00:03.964 --> 00:00:06.030
without phoning around for a free time?

00:00:06.616 --> 00:00:10.670
In this lesson I'll show you how to find a salon and book on VaraaAi.

00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:15.063
It takes about a minute, it's completely free, and you can book at any hour,

00:00:15.013 --> 00:00:15.950
even at midnight.

00:00:16.559 --> 00:00:17.249
Step one:

00:00:17.415 --> 00:00:18.369
find a salon.

00:00:18.478 --> 00:00:20.449
Open varaaai.com.

00:00:20.878 --> 00:00:25.489
In the box Service or salon, type what you need, for example, nails.

00:00:25.837 --> 00:00:30.689
In the Area box, type your city, or tap Near me to search around where you are.

00:00:31.032 --> 00:00:32.129
Then tap Search.

00:00:32.397 --> 00:00:35.729
You can also scroll down, and pick from Browse by category.

00:00:36.358 --> 00:00:40.390
The results show matching salons, with their rating and lowest price.

00:00:40.812 --> 00:00:43.110
You can view them as a list, or on a map.

00:00:43.539 --> 00:00:45.670
Tap the salon you like to open its page.

00:00:46.019 --> 00:00:49.990
There you'll find the address, the phone number, and three tabs:

00:00:50.019 --> 00:00:52.950
Services, Reviews, and Opening hours.

00:00:53.603 --> 00:00:54.410
Step two:

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:55.690
choose a service.

00:00:55.795 --> 00:00:58.970
Each service shows how long it takes, and what it costs.

00:00:59.239 --> 00:01:01.050
Tap Book, next to the one you want.

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:04.890
To have several services in one visit, tick each of them first.

00:01:05.555 --> 00:01:06.328
Step three:

00:01:06.547 --> 00:01:08.088
choose who, and when.

00:01:08.465 --> 00:01:13.048
Under Choose staff, pick the person you know, or leave it on Any available staff.

00:01:13.398 --> 00:01:15.688
Under Select date, tap the day you want.

00:01:16.037 --> 00:01:21.048
Select time then shows the free times, grouped into morning, afternoon and evening.

00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:22.568
Tap the time that suits you.

00:01:23.221 --> 00:01:24.099
Step four:

00:01:24.129 --> 00:01:25.139
your details.

00:01:25.407 --> 00:01:29.801
If you don't have an account yet, enter your full name, phone number, email,

00:01:29.751 --> 00:01:30.659
and a password.

00:01:30.927 --> 00:01:32.419
Your account is created for you.

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:34.899
If you already have one, tap Sign in.

00:01:35.247 --> 00:01:38.499
Under Choose a payment method, it's usually Pay at the salon,

00:01:38.449 --> 00:01:40.179
so you pay after your treatment.

00:01:40.386 --> 00:01:41.939
You can add a note for the salon.

00:01:42.115 --> 00:01:46.695
And if you have a discount code or a gift card, type it into the Discount code box,

00:01:46.645 --> 00:01:47.459
and tap Apply.

00:01:48.079 --> 00:01:48.919
Last step.

00:01:49.122 --> 00:01:50.519
Check the box Your appointment:

00:01:50.628 --> 00:01:53.879
the right service, the right date and time, and the price.

00:01:54.223 --> 00:01:59.399
Tick I accept the Cancellation Policy and Terms of Use, and tap Confirm booking.

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:02.759
The screen confirms your booking, and you get a confirmation email.

00:02:03.394 --> 00:02:06.127
Afterwards, open My bookings to see your appointment.

00:02:06.555 --> 00:02:09.348
If something comes up, you can cancel it there yourself,

00:02:09.298 --> 00:02:12.287
as long as you are within the salon's cancellation deadline.

00:02:12.527 --> 00:02:13.087
That's it!

00:02:13.424 --> 00:02:15.567
Take the quick quiz below to earn your points.
